498
00:44:53,013 --> 00:44:54,546
Can we go back to be friends?

499
00:44:55,346 --> 00:44:56,146
Never mind.

500
00:44:57,080 --> 00:44:58,413
We can just be friends again.

501
00:45:16,980 --> 00:45:17,780
